Revision history for Term-Chess

0.03    2026-10-13
        Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
        The keys, the screen and the steering are Game::Terminal::Kit's
        An empty NO_COLOR leaves colour on
        An escape sequence that is no known key no longer puts the piece back
        Add to_text and from_text, a game as a string and back by replay
        Add undo and redo, u and r in the picker, through Game::Terminal::Kit::History

0.02    2026-10-13
        Fix t/02-bot.t timing failure on slow hosts

0.01    2026-10-11
        First version
